      <title>华为 FreeBuds Neo 渲染图曝光：短柄设计加持最长 40 小时续航</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%BA-FreeBuds-Neo-%E6%B8%B2%E6%9F%93%E5%9B%BE%E6%9B%9D%E5%85%89%E7%9F%AD%E6%9F%84%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E5%8A%A0%E6%8C%81%E6%9C%80%E9%95%BF-40-%E5%B0%8F%E6%97%B6%E7%BB%AD%E8%88%AA/</link>
